OL,3,GNEWSATfL photocard breach exposes      
OL,4,A265,000 customers                      
OL,6,FIt said no photos, passwords, bank or  
OL,7,Fpayment card details or journey        
OL,8,Finformation were compromised, and      
OL,9,Faffected customers had been contacted. 
